// Test: Logical AND operator (&&)
// Spec: 01-LEXICAL.md § 3.2 Operators
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate logical AND works correctly.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print true (true && true)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !bool = true;
    ≔ y: !bool = true;
    println(x && y);
}
